      "text": "I’d choose the January 8 option departing SFO at 8:40 a.m. and arriving in Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. January 10: among the shown choices, it reaches Bangkok at the earliest listed time and has the shortest elapsed journey. The tradeoff is a separate, unverified ticket to Los Angeles before the Turkish Airlines award flight—so the connection and total price are not assured.",
